  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNOCHA ODSG Field Trip Turkey, Lebanon and Jordan, 2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As Chair of the OCHA Donor Support Group (ODSG) Denmark participated in the ODSG Field Mission to Turkey, Lebanon and Jordan. The purpose of the trip was to develop a better insight into the work of OCHA in and around the Syria Crisis. The grant was given to help fund OCHA&apos;s direct extra-expenses in relation to the Field Mission.</narrative>
